    <item>
      <title>Shutdown Proxmox VM using CLI</title>
      <link>https://www.shafiq.in/blog/shutdown-proxmox-vm-using-cli/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Oct 2023 01:30:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.shafiq.in/blog/shutdown-proxmox-vm-using-cli/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;SSH into the Proxmox host and run:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;qm shutdown &amp;lt;VMID&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This sends an ACPI shutdown signal to the guest OS for a graceful shutdown.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find the VM ID:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;qm list
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the VM doesn&amp;rsquo;t respond to the shutdown signal, force it:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;qm stop &amp;lt;VMID&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;qm stop&lt;/code&gt; is equivalent to pulling the power cable. Use it only when &lt;code&gt;qm shutdown&lt;/code&gt; hangs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
